WEBVTT

00:00:02.581 --> 00:00:07.275
The Class by form factor: one screen where there is room, and one column where there

00:00:07.275 --> 00:00:07.966
is not.

00:00:10.324 --> 00:00:15.050
In landscape, on a tablet or a desktop, The Class is one screen, and nothing

00:00:15.050 --> 00:00:19.962
scrolls. The video takes the height that is left and stays sixteen by nine. The

00:00:19.962 --> 00:00:24.117
details and the start button keep a fixed column on the right.

00:00:25.809 --> 00:00:30.919
At ten twenty-four by seven sixty-eight, the column is drawn tighter, so every state

00:00:30.919 --> 00:00:35.785
still fits. In a window shorter still, the video gives up its height first. Only

00:00:35.785 --> 00:00:39.127
then does the page scroll, and nothing is cut off.

00:00:41.295 --> 00:00:46.529
On a phone, or a tablet in portrait, it is one column: video, details, how to ride,

00:00:46.529 --> 00:00:51.637
then what the bike will do. The start button stays pinned to the bottom, clear of

00:00:51.637 --> 00:00:54.585
the home bar, and nothing hides behind it.

00:00:56.780 --> 00:01:01.313
In either layout there is exactly one start button, and the Tab key stops at it

00:01:01.313 --> 00:01:01.900
once.

00:01:07.104 --> 00:01:09.883
The same screen, from a phone to a desktop.

00:01:17.428 --> 00:01:22.581
The tests came first. Three failed, as expected; thirty-four passed at once, on the

00:01:22.581 --> 00:01:27.672
layout carried over. Now two hundred and twenty-eight specs and one thousand three

00:01:27.672 --> 00:01:30.393
hundred and sixty-five unit tests pass.

00:01:32.913 --> 00:01:38.568
Telo Ride 1, from the Telo family, is the focused edition of Telo Ride: one class,

00:01:38.568 --> 00:01:39.764
nothing else.

00:01:40.109 --> 00:01:45.061
It pairs with a smart bike at home over Bluetooth, plays the class video, or draws

00:01:45.061 --> 00:01:50.073
the Ibiza Sunset Strip course to music if the rider chooses it, and sets the bike's

00:01:50.073 --> 00:01:53.574
resistance for every interval while the rider pedals.

00:01:53.919 --> 00:01:57.895
Connect the bike, take the class, see your number, and come back to beat it.
